  m_text: Just like any other player, your goalkeeper can be moved in a <link="movement_phase"><color=#79CEF2><u>Movement
    Phase</u></color></link>. Your goalkeeper can also be moved 1 hex when the ball
    comes into the box by an opponent touch (dribble, pass, header). If the ball
    was sent in the box by a teammate (pass, dribble, header, loose ball from a tackle/header),
    the GK does <b>not</b> get that 1 extra Hex.
