  m_text: '<b>Remember</b>: <i>If the GK collects a loose ball outside the penalty
    area, they follow any other scenario. If they wish to pick the ball up, the GK
    only picks the ball up once the phase in which he is brought back into the box
    completely finishes. If the GK collects a loose ball within the penalty area,
    they pick it up immediately.</i>'
