  m_text: Refer to the numbers 1-6 printed on the pitch. This helps you determine
    where the ball will break. The ball deflects from the centre of the incident
    (i.e. where the ball was supposed to travel, or from the defender who challenged
    for a tackle or <link="heading"><color=#79CEF2><u>Header</u></color></link>)
