  m_text: After an in-bounds Long Pass lands, accurate or inaccurate, the defending
    manager gets one opportunity to move their goalkeeper according to Pace, or decline
    with [X]. Finish this decision before any landing recovery/interception roll,
    automatic direct recovery, recipient action options or Final Thirds continuation.
    Then recheck the current landing occupancy and zones of influence; a direct defensive
    recipient still recovers automatically without a roll.
