  m_text: "\u2022 If the loose ball <i>hits</i> an attacker during a <link=\"movement_phase\"><color=#79CEF2><u>Movement
    Phase</u></color></link>, <b>continue</b> the <link=\"movement_phase\"><color=#79CEF2><u>Movement
    Phase</u></color></link>, or if you were not in a <link=\"movement_phase\"><color=#79CEF2><u>Movement
    Phase</u></color></link>, begin one with the attacking team moving first, but
    the attacker can choose to <b>Snapshot</b> immediately."
