  m_text: 'If your opponent rolls a 1 when making a tackle or a steal then a foul
    has been committed. Roll the dice to check for an injury (see below). You now
    have two choices: take the free kick or continue play. If the foul is inside
    the penalty area, you may take the penalty kick or play on. Play must stop if
    the foul requires a sending-off or a mandatory substitution.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
