  m_text: Play continues with a high pass or a low pass. A high pass can be made
    to any position within the penalty area because there are no distance restrictions
    at a corner kick. Corner kicks are always accurate when the game is played without
    Advanced rules. Following a high pass, a <link="heading"><color=#79CEF2><u>Header</u></color></link>
    must be attempted.
