  m_text: "\u2022 The attacker must call the attempt for a nutmeg when approaching
    the defender, so that the targeted defender does not get a steal attempt. Other
    closeby defenders get their chance for a steal, including the defenders whose
    ZOI the attacker lands after the successful nutmeg."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
