  m_text: "\u2022 If the loose ball ends in the Zone of Influence (ZOI) of a defender,
    they may try to attract the ball by rolling a 6 OR \"Tackling + Dice\" <noparse>></noparse>=
    10. If this is successful play is followed by \"Any Other Scenario\""
