  m_text: If a foul has been committed within the penalty area, the attacking manager
    may decide to take the penalty kick or play on. Before play continues and ijury
    check and card check must take place.  With a penalty, both teams pick up and
    reposition all of their players. Only 2 players (the penalty kick taker and the
    defending goalkeeper) may be inside the penalty area. No players allowed in the
    penalty <b>arc</b>.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
