  m_text: Headed attempts at goal cannot be blocked or intercepted by defenders.
    If the attacker has won a duel with a defender, the goalkeeper now rolls to attempt
    a <link="shooting"><color=#79CEF2><u>save</u></color></link>. The attacker does
    not re-roll. Start counting Hexes from <b>THE BALL</b>, not the winner of the
    headed challenge.
