  m_text: In a Heading Duel in which a Shot has been declared by the Attacker, if
    the best score has been achieved by an Attacker with a dice roll of 1 (ex. H6
    + Roll 1 vs. H3 + Roll 3), only then is the Headed shot an automatic miss OFF
    TARGET. All challenging Defensive players still need to roll to determine if
    they win the duel.
