  m_text: "\u2022 <b>Drop the Ball</b>: The GK drops the ball and is now treated
    as an outfield player. From here the attacking team can declare a movement phase,
    standard pass, high pass or long ball however normal outfield player distances,
    accuracy checks and rules apply. The GK cannot pick the ball up again after dropping
    it."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
