      m_Calls: []
  m_text: The Attacking team, if there is no challenge from the Defence, and the
    ball lands within range of an attacker, must declare a Header or a Control attempt
    and then proceed with a <link="movement_phase"><color=#79CEF2><u>Movement Phase</u></color></link>.
    If the ball is in range for a Header, <link="movement_phase"><color=#79CEF2><u>Movement
    Phase</u></color></link> in not an option for the attack.
