      m_Calls: []
  m_text: If the High Pass is played into the penalty box, the goalkeeper also gets
    to move 1 hex.  After a High Pass the defending GK has the option to move 3 Hexes
    if and only if he will be challenging for the High Pass. Those 3 hexes cannot
    be combined with a 3 hexes movement from the regular high pass rule.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
