  m_text: "\u2022 When a defender picks up a ball that was <link=\"loose_ball\"><color=#79CEF2><u>loose</u></color></link>,
    the movement ends immediately and play resumes with any other scenario. If you
    pick it up with the <link=\"goalkeeper\"><color=#79CEF2><u>Goalkeeper</u></color></link>
    within the penalty box using your hands, and continue play as if you Saved and
    Held a shot."
