  m_text: Goalkeepers do not have a Tackling attribute, but they can instead dive
    with their hands at a player's feet. To try this, you and your opponent roll
    the dice. Add your Saving attribute to the dice roll and compare that to the
    attacker's Dribbling attribute plus dice roll.
