  m_text: Goalkeepers can run to get the ball. If the ball is in their penalty box
    and it did not come from a teammate's kick, they can pick it up using their gloves.
    Continue Play as if there was a save and Hold. You can only pick the ball up
    when a <link="movement_phase"><color=#79CEF2><u>Movement Phase</u></color></link>
    ends (with a change of possession or regularly).
