      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "When a headed pass reaches your goalkeeper inside their own penalty area,
    choose hands [H] or feet [F]. Hands requires a normal D6 catch roll with no attribute
    modifier: 2\u20136 means held and offers goalkeeper distribution; 1 starts a
    <link=\"loose_ball\"><color=#79CEF2><u>Loose Ball</u></color></link> from the
    goalkeeper. Feet requires no roll and continues the headed-pass flow. Outside
    their own penalty area the goalkeeper receives at feet and cannot choose hands."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c5fdfdb697f0641feb89600dc51bf367, type: 2}
